---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout title="Services" description="AI-powered business automations: missed call text-back, review automation, AI receptionists, instant quotes, no-show recovery, and more. Built in minutes for local businesses.">
  <!-- Hero Section -->
  <section class="bg-gradient-to-br from-secondary-900 to-secondary-800 text-white py-16">
    <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 text-center">
      <h1 class="text-4xl lg:text-5xl font-bold mb-4">The 10 Automations Local Businesses Pay For</h1>
      <p class="text-xl text-secondary-300 max-w-3xl mx-auto">
        Each one built in under 10 minutes. Runs 24/7. Self-heals when something breaks.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Pricing Overview -->
  <section class="py-12 bg-primary-600 text-white">
    <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
      <div class="grid md:grid-cols-4 gap-6 text-center">
        <div class="bg-primary-700/50 rounded-lg p-4">
          <div class="font-bold text-lg">Basic</div>
          <div class="text-2xl font-bold">$500 - $1,200</div>
          <div class="text-primary-200 text-sm">1-3 integrations</div>
        </div>
        <div class="bg-primary-700/50 rounded-lg p-4">
          <div class="font-bold text-lg">Standard</div>
          <div class="text-2xl font-bold">$1,200 - $2,500</div>
          <div class="text-primary-200 text-sm">Conditional logic</div>
        </div>
        <div class="bg-primary-700/50 rounded-lg p-4">
          <div class="font-bold text-lg">Advanced</div>
          <div class="text-2xl font-bold">$2,500 - $5,000</div>
          <div class="text-primary-200 text-sm">AI processing</div>
        </div>
        <div class="bg-primary-700/50 rounded-lg p-4">
          <div class="font-bold text-lg">Bundle</div>
          <div class="text-2xl font-bold">$4,000 - $8,000</div>
          <div class="text-primary-200 text-sm">3-5 workflows</div>
        </div>
      </div>
      <p class="text-center mt-4 text-primary-200">+ Optional monthly retainer: $200 - $800/mo for monitoring & support</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Automations List -->
  <section class="py-20 bg-white">
    <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">

      <!-- Automation 1 -->
      <div class="grid lg:grid-cols-2 gap-12 items-center mb-20 pb-20 border-b border-secondary-200">
        <div>
          <div class="flex items-center gap-4 mb-4">
            <span class="text-4xl font-bold text-primary-600">01</span>
            <span class="bg-green-100 text-green-700 px-3 py-1 rounded-full text-sm font-semibold">Most Popular</span>
          </div>
          <h2 class="text-3xl font-bold text-secondary-900 mb-2">Missed Call Text-Back</h2>
          <div class="text-primary-600 font-bold text-xl mb-4">$800 - $1,500 setup</div>

          <div class="bg-red-50 border border-red-100 rounded-lg p-4 mb-6">
            <div class="font-bold text-red-700 mb-1">The Problem:</div>
            <p class="text-red-600">68% of missed calls from new customers never call back. That's revenue walking out the door every single day.</p>
          </div>

          <div class="bg-green-50 border border-green-100 rounded-lg p-4 mb-6">
            <div class="font-bold text-green-700 mb-1">What It Does:</div>
            <p class="text-green-600">When a call goes unanswered, instantly sends personalized SMS: "Hey, sorry we missed you. How can we help?" Routes replies to you or books appointments automatically.</p>
          </div>

          <div class="flex items-center gap-4 text-secondary-500">
            <span class="flex items-center gap-1">
              <svg class="w-4 h-4" fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 20 20"><path fill-rule="evenodd" d="M10 18a8 8 0 100-16 8 8 0 000 16zm1-12a1 1 0 10-2 0v4a1 1 0 00.293.707l2.828 2.829a1 1 0 101.415-1.415L11 9.586V6z" clip-rule="evenodd"/></svg>
              3 min build
            </span>
            <span>Best for: HVAC, Plumbers, Dentists, Salons, Contractors</span>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="bg-secondary-100 rounded-2xl p-8">
          <div class="space-y-4">
            <div class="flex items-center gap-3">
              <div class="w-8 h-8 bg-red-500 rounded-full flex items-center justify-center text-white text-sm">1</div>
              <div class="flex-1 bg-white rounded-lg p-3 shadow-sm">Missed call detected from (256) 555-0123</div>
            </div>
            <div class="flex items-center gap-3">
              <div class="w-8 h-8 bg-yellow-500 rounded-full flex items-center justify-center text-white text-sm">2</div>
              <div class="flex-1 bg-white rounded-lg p-3 shadow-sm">Wait 30 seconds...</div>
            </div>
            <div class="flex items-center gap-3">
              <div class="w-8 h-8 bg-green-500 rounded-full flex items-center justify-center text-white text-sm">3</div>
              <div class="flex-1 bg-white rounded-lg p-3 shadow-sm">"Hey, sorry we missed your call! How can we help?"</div>
            </div>
            <div class="flex items-center gap-3">
              <div class="w-8 h-8 bg-primary-500 rounded-full flex items-center justify-center text-white text-sm">4</div>
              <div class="flex-1 bg-white rounded-lg p-3 shadow-sm">Reply routed to owner's phone</div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Automation 2 -->
      <div class="grid lg:grid-cols-2 gap-12 items-center mb-20 pb-20 border-b border-secondary-200">
        <div class="order-2 lg:order-1 bg-secondary-100 rounded-2xl p-8">
          <div class="bg-white rounded-lg p-4 shadow-sm mb-4">
            <div class="text-sm text-secondary-500 mb-2">SMS Sent:</div>
            <p class="text-secondary-800">"Thanks for choosing us! If you had a great experience, would you mind leaving a quick review?"</p>
            <div class="mt-3 text-primary-600 underline">Leave a Google Review</div>
          </div>
          <div class="flex items-center justify-between bg-white rounded-lg p-4 shadow-sm">
            <span class="text-secondary-600">Reviews this week:</span>
            <span class="text-2xl font-bold text-green-600">+12</span>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="order-1 lg:order-2">
          <div class="flex items-center gap-4 mb-4">
            <span class="text-4xl font-bold text-primary-600">02</span>
          </div>
          <h2 class="text-3xl font-bold text-secondary-900 mb-2">Review Request Automation</h2>
          <div class="text-primary-600 font-bold text-xl mb-4">$500 - $1,200 setup</div>

          <div class="bg-red-50 border border-red-100 rounded-lg p-4 mb-6">
            <div class="font-bold text-red-700 mb-1">The Problem:</div>
            <p class="text-red-600">Most businesses have 10x more happy customers than Google reviews. They just never ask.</p>
          </div>

          <div class="bg-green-50 border border-green-100 rounded-lg p-4 mb-6">
            <div class="font-bold text-green-700 mb-1">What It Does:</div>
            <p class="text-green-600">24 hours after service completion, sends review request via SMS with direct Google review link. Follows up once if no action. Tracks who reviewed.</p>
          </div>

          <div class="flex items-center gap-4 text-secondary-500">
            <span class="flex items-center gap-1">
              <svg class="w-4 h-4" fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 20 20"><path fill-rule="evenodd" d="M10 18a8 8 0 100-16 8 8 0 000 16zm1-12a1 1 0 10-2 0v4a1 1 0 00.293.707l2.828 2.829a1 1 0 101.415-1.415L11 9.586V6z" clip-rule="evenodd"/></svg>
              4 min build
            </span>
            <span>Best for: Restaurants, Clinics, Cleaning Companies, Auto Shops</span>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Automation 3 -->
      <div class="grid lg:grid-cols-2 gap-12 items-center mb-20 pb-20 border-b border-secondary-200">
        <div>
          <div class="flex items-center gap-4 mb-4">
            <span class="text-4xl font-bold text-primary-600">03</span>
            <span class="bg-yellow-100 text-yellow-700 px-3 py-1 rounded-full text-sm font-semibold">High ROI</span>
          </div>
          <h2 class="text-3xl font-bold text-secondary-900 mb-2">No-Show Recovery</h2>
          <div class="text-primary-600 font-bold text-xl mb-4">$1,200 - $2,500 setup</div>

          <div class="bg-red-50 border border-red-100 rounded-lg p-4 mb-6">
            <div class="font-bold text-red-700 mb-1">The Problem:</div>
            <p class="text-red-600">No-shows cost the average service business $67,000/year. Most owners just eat the loss.</p>
          </div>

          <div class="bg-green-50 border border-green-100 rounded-lg p-4 mb-6">
            <div class="font-bold text-green-700 mb-1">What It Does:</div>
            <p class="text-green-600">Detects no-shows from calendar, waits 10 minutes, sends empathetic rebooking message with 3 available slots. Follows up once more. Recovers 30-40% of lost appointments.</p>
          </div>

          <div class="flex items-center gap-4 text-secondary-500">
            <span class="flex items-center gap-1">
              <svg class="w-4 h-4" fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 20 20"><path fill-rule="evenodd" d="M10 18a8 8 0 100-16 8 8 0 000 16zm1-12a1 1 0 10-2 0v4a1 1 0 00.293.707l2.828 2.829a1 1 0 101.415-1.415L11 9.586V6z" clip-rule="evenodd"/></svg>
              5 min build
            </span>
            <span>Best for: PT Clinics, Med Spas, Salons, Therapists</span>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="bg-secondary-100 rounded-2xl p-8">
          <div class="bg-white rounded-lg p-4 shadow-sm mb-4">
            <div class="text-sm text-secondary-500 mb-2">Sent to Sarah (no-show):</div>
            <p class="text-secondary-800">"Hi Sarah, we missed you today! No worries - would you like to rebook? Here are 3 available times:"</p>
            <div class="mt-3 space-y-2">
              <div class="bg-primary-50 text-primary-700 rounded px-3 py-2 text-sm">Tomorrow 2:00 PM</div>
              <div class="bg-primary-50 text-primary-700 rounded px-3 py-2 text-sm">Thursday 10:00 AM</div>
              <div class="bg-primary-50 text-primary-700 rounded px-3 py-2 text-sm">Friday 3:30 PM</div>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="text-center text-green-600 font-bold">30-40% recovery rate</div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Automation 4 -->
      <div class="grid lg:grid-cols-2 gap-12 items-center mb-20 pb-20 border-b border-secondary-200">
        <div class="order-2 lg:order-1 bg-secondary-100 rounded-2xl p-8">
          <div class="bg-secondary-800 text-white rounded-lg p-4 mb-4">
            <div class="flex items-center gap-2 mb-2">
              <div class="w-2 h-2 bg-green-400 rounded-full animate-pulse"></div>
              <span class="text-sm">AI Receptionist - Active</span>
            </div>
            <p class="text-secondary-300 text-sm">"Thanks for calling! I can help you with appointments, pricing, or connect you with the team. What do you need?"</p>
          </div>
          <div class="grid grid-cols-2 gap-4">
            <div class="bg-white rounded-lg p-3 text-center">
              <div class="text-2xl font-bold text-primary-600">24/7</div>
              <div class="text-sm text-secondary-500">Availability</div>
            </div>
            <div class="bg-white rounded-lg p-3 text-center">
              <div class="text-2xl font-bold text-primary-600">$35K</div>
              <div class="text-sm text-secondary-500">Saved vs. hiring</div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="order-1 lg:order-2">
          <div class="flex items-center gap-4 mb-4">
            <span class="text-4xl font-bold text-primary-600">04</span>
            <span class="bg-purple-100 text-purple-700 px-3 py-1 rounded-full text-sm font-semibold">Premium</span>
          </div>
          <h2 class="text-3xl font-bold text-secondary-900 mb-2">AI Receptionist + Call Routing</h2>
          <div class="text-primary-600 font-bold text-xl mb-4">$2,000 - $4,000 setup</div>

          <div class="bg-red-50 border border-red-100 rounded-lg p-4 mb-6">
            <div class="font-bold text-red-700 mb-1">The Problem:</div>
            <p class="text-red-600">Hiring a receptionist costs $35K+/year. After hours, every call goes to voicemail and dies.</p>
          </div>

          <div class="bg-green-50 border border-green-100 rounded-lg p-4 mb-6">
            <div class="font-bold text-green-700 mb-1">What It Does:</div>
            <p class="text-green-600">AI answers calls 24/7, handles common questions (hours, pricing, location), books appointments, and routes urgent calls to owner's cell. Logs every interaction.</p>
          </div>

          <div class="flex items-center gap-4 text-secondary-500">
            <span class="flex items-center gap-1">
              <svg class="w-4 h-4" fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 20 20"><path fill-rule="evenodd" d="M10 18a8 8 0 100-16 8 8 0 000 16zm1-12a1 1 0 10-2 0v4a1 1 0 00.293.707l2.828 2.829a1 1 0 101.415-1.415L11 9.586V6z" clip-rule="evenodd"/></svg>
              8 min build
            </span>
            <span>Best for: Law Firms, Medical Offices, Property Management</span>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Automation 5 -->
      <div class="grid lg:grid-cols-2 gap-12 items-center mb-20 pb-20 border-b border-secondary-200">
        <div>
          <div class="flex items-center gap-4 mb-4">
            <span class="text-4xl font-bold text-primary-600">05</span>
          </div>
          <h2 class="text-3xl font-bold text-secondary-900 mb-2">Instant Quote Generator</h2>
          <div class="text-primary-600 font-bold text-xl mb-4">$1,500 - $3,000 setup</div>

          <div class="bg-red-50 border border-red-100 rounded-lg p-4 mb-6">
            <div class="font-bold text-red-700 mb-1">The Problem:</div>
            <p class="text-red-600">"We'll get back to you in 2-3 days" means they already called your competitor.</p>
          </div>

          <div class="bg-green-50 border border-green-100 rounded-lg p-4 mb-6">
            <div class="font-bold text-green-700 mb-1">What It Does:</div>
            <p class="text-green-600">Client fills short form, AI generates accurate quote based on your pricing rules, sends branded PDF instantly. Owner gets notified. Follow-up if no response in 48 hours.</p>
          </div>

          <div class="flex items-center gap-4 text-secondary-500">
            <span class="flex items-center gap-1">
              <svg class="w-4 h-4" fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 20 20"><path fill-rule="evenodd" d="M10 18a8 8 0 100-16 8 8 0 000 16zm1-12a1 1 0 10-2 0v4a1 1 0 00.293.707l2.828 2.829a1 1 0 101.415-1.415L11 9.586V6z" clip-rule="evenodd"/></svg>
              7 min build
            </span>
            <span>Best for: Cleaning Companies, Landscapers, Movers</span>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="bg-secondary-100 rounded-2xl p-8">
          <div class="bg-white rounded-lg shadow-sm overflow-hidden">
            <div class="bg-primary-600 text-white p-3 text-center font-bold">Your Quote</div>
            <div class="p-4 space-y-3">
              <div class="flex justify-between"><span>Deep Clean (2,400 sq ft)</span><span class="font-bold">$350</span></div>
              <div class="flex justify-between"><span>Window Cleaning</span><span class="font-bold">$75</span></div>
              <div class="flex justify-between"><span>Carpet Treatment</span><span class="font-bold">$125</span></div>
              <div class="border-t pt-3 flex justify-between text-lg font-bold"><span>Total</span><span class="text-primary-600">$550</span></div>
            </div>
            <div class="bg-green-50 p-3 text-center text-green-700 text-sm">Sent in under 60 seconds</div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- More Automations Grid -->
      <div class="text-center mb-12">
        <h2 class="text-3xl font-bold text-secondary-900 mb-4">5 More Automations</h2>
      </div>

      <div class="grid md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3 gap-8">
        <!-- 6 -->
        <div class="bg-secondary-50 p-8 rounded-xl border border-secondary-200">
          <span class="text-2xl font-bold text-primary-600">06</span>
          <h3 class="text-xl font-bold mt-2 mb-2">Client Onboarding Sequence</h3>
          <div class="text-primary-600 font-semibold mb-3">$1,800 - $3,500</div>
          <p class="text-secondary-600 text-sm mb-4">When deal closes: welcome email, collect documents, schedule kickoff, generate invoice, notify team. All automatic.</p>
          <div class="text-xs text-secondary-500">Best for: Agencies, Consultants, Accountants, Coaches</div>
        </div>

        <!-- 7 -->
        <div class="bg-secondary-50 p-8 rounded-xl border border-secondary-200">
          <span class="text-2xl font-bold text-primary-600">07</span>
          <h3 class="text-xl font-bold mt-2 mb-2">Invoice Follow-Up + Payment Recovery</h3>
          <div class="text-primary-600 font-semibold mb-3">$1,000 - $2,000</div>
          <p class="text-secondary-600 text-sm mb-4">Monitors invoices. Friendly reminder at 3 days, firmer at 7 days, alerts you at 14 days. Reduces late payments by 60%.</p>
          <div class="text-xs text-secondary-500">Best for: Any service business that invoices</div>
        </div>

        <!-- 8 -->
        <div class="bg-secondary-50 p-8 rounded-xl border border-secondary-200">
          <span class="text-2xl font-bold text-primary-600">08</span>
          <h3 class="text-xl font-bold mt-2 mb-2">Social Proof Collector</h3>
          <div class="text-primary-600 font-semibold mb-3">$600 - $1,200</div>
          <p class="text-secondary-600 text-sm mb-4">After positive interaction, auto-request testimonial via text. Formats and queues for posting to Google, social, or website.</p>
          <div class="text-xs text-secondary-500">Best for: Any local business with repeat customers</div>
        </div>

        <!-- 9 -->
        <div class="bg-secondary-50 p-8 rounded-xl border border-secondary-200">
          <span class="text-2xl font-bold text-primary-600">09</span>
          <h3 class="text-xl font-bold mt-2 mb-2">Lead Scoring + Routing</h3>
          <div class="text-primary-600 font-semibold mb-3">$1,500 - $3,000</div>
          <p class="text-secondary-600 text-sm mb-4">AI scores leads by budget signals, company size, urgency. Hot leads trigger instant SMS to you. Warm leads enter nurture sequence.</p>
          <div class="text-xs text-secondary-500">Best for: Real Estate, Agencies, B2B Services</div>
        </div>

        <!-- 10 -->
        <div class="bg-secondary-50 p-8 rounded-xl border border-secondary-200">
          <span class="text-2xl font-bold text-primary-600">10</span>
          <h3 class="text-xl font-bold mt-2 mb-2">Weekly Owner Dashboard</h3>
          <div class="text-primary-600 font-semibold mb-3">$1,200 - $2,500</div>
          <p class="text-secondary-600 text-sm mb-4">Every Monday 7am: pulls data from Stripe, Google, CRM, calendar. Clean summary email with trends and action items.</p>
          <div class="text-xs text-secondary-500">Best for: Any owner running a $500K+ business</div>
        </div>

        <!-- Custom -->
        <div class="bg-primary-600 text-white p-8 rounded-xl">
          <span class="text-2xl font-bold">?</span>
          <h3 class="text-xl font-bold mt-2 mb-2">Custom Automation</h3>
          <div class="font-semibold mb-3">Let's talk</div>
          <p class="text-primary-100 text-sm mb-4">Have a specific problem? Tell us what's annoying you most. We'll build the solution live.</p>
          <a href="/contact" class="inline-block bg-white text-primary-600 px-4 py-2 rounded-lg font-semibold text-sm hover:bg-primary-50 transition-colors">Get Started</a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- CTA Section -->
  <section class="py-20 bg-secondary-900 text-white">
    <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 text-center">
      <h2 class="text-3xl lg:text-4xl font-bold mb-4">Bundle & Save</h2>
      <p class="text-xl text-secondary-300 mb-8">
        One workflow at $1,500 is a hard sell. Three workflows at $3,500 is a no-brainer package.
      </p>
      <div class="bg-secondary-800 rounded-2xl p-8 mb-8">
        <div class="text-sm text-secondary-400 mb-2">Most Popular Bundle</div>
        <div class="text-2xl font-bold mb-4">The Lead Recovery Stack</div>
        <div class="flex flex-wrap justify-center gap-4 mb-6">
          <span class="bg-secondary-700 px-4 py-2 rounded-lg">Missed Call Text-Back</span>
          <span class="bg-secondary-700 px-4 py-2 rounded-lg">Review Automation</span>
          <span class="bg-secondary-700 px-4 py-2 rounded-lg">No-Show Recovery</span>
        </div>
        <div class="text-4xl font-bold text-primary-400">$3,500</div>
        <div class="text-secondary-400">+ $400/mo retainer for monitoring & support</div>
      </div>
      <a href="/contact" class="inline-flex items-center bg-primary-600 hover:bg-primary-700 text-white px-8 py-4 rounded-lg font-semibold text-lg transition-colors">
        Schedule Live Demo
        <svg class="w-5 h-5 ml-2" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
          <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M17 8l4 4m0 0l-4 4m4-4H3"/>
        </svg>
      </a>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>
